{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_01_end","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":3,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_01_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-1","storyName":"嘈杂的天空","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"“幸运瘤兽”的经理前去注销资质，在工作人员的指点下，他拨通了一个神秘号码。另一边，一名陌生的男子找到高登，自称是前来报到的讲解员奥克里——可园区内已经存在一位同名同姓的讲解员了。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_01_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":1,"next":3,"characters":["惊慌的女孩","斯凯","街头混混A","街头混混B","？？？？","？？？","娜斯提","工作人员","雅斯彭","梅希亚","高登","陌生的男子"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"image","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":6},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":7},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_bg_29_g8_alley_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":8},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":11},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"true","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"0","ato":"1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":16},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"20,0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的女孩","text":"哥......安德鲁！你又被他们打了吗？","id":21},{"type":"dialog","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#8$2","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"叫我斯凯。","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的女孩","text":"可那是你自己取的名字，爸妈说......","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#11$2","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"别提他们！自己没出息就只会在咱俩身上撒气的畜生，他们有什么资格决定我叫什么？","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#11$2","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我在特里蒙理工擦了六年的地板，偷听完了所有本科课程，就是为了以后不像他们一样窝囊、愚蠢、没用！","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的女孩","text":"可是......","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$2","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"还有你！除了每天往我包里贴唠唠叨叨的便签，还能做点别的吗？我又不是不知道吃饭——","id":34},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"charslot","id":36},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.8","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1044_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1044_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":41},{"type":"charslot","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$2","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"0","ato":"1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的女孩","text":"那群人又来了......","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1043_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-130,0","duration":"0.5","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"130,0","duration":"0.5","id":49},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#6$2","isblock":"true","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"他妈的......没完了是吗？赶紧的，躲我身后。","id":52},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"charslot","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1044_1#1$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1044_1#1$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"街头混混A","text":"穿一身白大褂，真以为自己是什么人物了？你和那个小姑娘就是穿上总统的衣服，也是贫民窟来的贱种。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1044_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","volume":"1","id":60},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":61},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","volume":"1","id":63},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#10$2","posfrom":"0,-60","posto":"0,0","duration":"2","isblock":"false","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"7","times":"30","duration":"0.5","isblock":"false","id":67},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"哈......阴沟里的鼷兽，一辈子都理解不了什么叫伟大。","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","name":"avg_npc_1044_1#1$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"街头混混B","text":"你再说一句试试？！","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1044_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":72},{"type":"charslot","id":73},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp2","volume":"1","id":74},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"1","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的女孩","text":"哥！","id":79},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":80},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"charslot","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":83},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":84},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_energybeamfire","volume":"0.6","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":86},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_38_i16.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"2.5","yScale":"2.5","fadetime":"0.1","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":88},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":89},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_collapse","volume":"1","id":90},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"0.7","id":91},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"3","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2.5","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$act25side_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act25side/m_sys_act25side_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":95,"musicid":0},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"街头混混A","text":"什、什么东西？","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"街头混混B","text":"天灾？快跑！","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"还“天灾”？那他妈叫探索！叫进步！","id":99},{"type":"text","text":"浑身青紫的青年望向天空，忘记了自己在一个肮脏的小巷里，忘记了身后还有一个惊慌的女孩。","id":100},{"type":"text","text":"他不受控制地向那束伟大的天光追去。","id":101},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","duration":"7","block":"false","id":103},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":104},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"5","id":106},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"charslot","id":110},{"type":"image","id":111},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_29_g7_mainstreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_892_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"0.8","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_891_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？？","text":"你就不担心总辖？","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_892_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"她什么时候需要我们担心。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_891_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我们是同行者，我们只是同行者。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_891_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我们只需要做好自己的事，然后......祝她好运。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_891_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（萨卡兹语）若有一天，卡兹戴尔亦悬于天顶，我将在火炉上镌刻你的名字。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_891_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"charslot","id":126},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":127},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$2","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"呼......呼......","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$2","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"不、不好意思，女士......","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$2","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"能不能告诉我，那个人，天上的那个伟大的人......","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#12$2","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"叫什么名字？","id":137},{"type":"dialog","id":138},{"type":"charslot","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_891_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","isblock":"true","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_891_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"克丽斯腾。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_891_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"她叫克丽斯腾·莱特。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_891_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"charslot","id":145},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"3","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":146},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":147},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":149},{"type":"charslot","id":150},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"false","id":151},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_bg_38_g10_ecolab.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","posfrom":"10,0","posto":"10,0","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","posfrom":"-10,0","posto":"-10,0","id":155},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":157},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":158,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"娜斯提主任，幸运瘤兽餐饮公司明天就会去注销进驻资质。","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"他们没通过复检？","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"远没有达到标准。他们是最早进驻园区的转型企业之一，为了迎合民众的“天空热”，当时的审核条件不够严格——","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"他们雇佣的体验员呢，会去哪里？","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#8$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"那个经理连电机的种类都分不清，我猜他只是想借着“螺旋桨天堂”的名头大捞一笔......","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"嗯？你刚刚问我什么？","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"没什么。你倒是很喜欢这个园区的名字。","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我更希望它能被直接称作“万星园”。","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"斯凯，我知道你不赞成公开环形实验室的技术遗产。","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我无意指责“总辖代理”的决定，但过分保守的决策只会让我们失去应得的尊重。","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"一星半点的数据支持让大批科技公司焕发新生；照亮千万哥伦比亚民众的环形实验室，被做成五岁小孩就能玩的益智玩具......","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"现在，每个哥伦比亚人都会把“太空”和“宇宙”挂在嘴边，却很少有人记得，这些全新的语汇出自克丽斯腾公开的实验日志。","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"没有一个人在真正地悼念克丽斯腾，甚至是你，娜斯提主任。","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"记录和回顾是史学家的工作。我们只需要分析经过验证的数据，遵循切实有效的方向。","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"可这些数据和方向变成了什么呢？","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"近两年莱茵收购了十几个小型实验室，大大小小的项目都在推进，唯独克丽斯腾的遗产被搁置了。","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"这次展会上，我们将首次公布莱茵对万星园的后续研究成果，让不入流的科技公司心服口服，回到天空探索的领域，回到公众视野。","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我知道生态园建立在环形实验室回传数据的基础上，也知道用植物传输能量、搭建供能系统在工程设计上是一大壮举。","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#8$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"培育幼苗、铺设种植单元、工程检修，都是为了精进我们的实验......但一座在预展上都没机会露面的“植物园”真的足够吗？","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#8$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"......","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"恳请你告诉我，娜斯提主任。正如那个夜晚之前，没人知道克丽斯腾即将突破天幕，莱茵在这里还有更大的目标，对吗？","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"特里蒙的夜晚已经过去很久了。","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"......","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"去准备下一家企业的检修吧。注意名单顺序，发生了一些调整。","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"是。","id":208},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-10,0","posto":"-30,0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"false","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"斯凯。","id":213},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"......","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我理解你的心情，也知道你是受到克丽斯腾的鼓舞才选择入职莱茵。","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#8$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"那天晚上有很多人抬头看向天空，但不是所有人都会去追逐它。","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"别忘了让你迈出第一步的原因。","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"......我先去准备检修资料了，主任。","id":225},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-30,0","posto":"-50,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#9$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"......","id":231},{"type":"dialog","id":232},{"type":"dialog","id":233},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":236},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_bg_38_g13_trimountlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"......请拿好您的权限卡、协议和园区通用联络黄页，再次欢迎您的团队加入“螺旋桨天堂”！","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"下一位！请问有什么可以帮您的？","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"charslot","id":245},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#2$1","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"注销进驻资质......","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"您代表的企业是？","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"幸运瘤兽餐饮。","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"一共需要解约八十二名体验员是吗？","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#2$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"对，他们的资料连同我本人的都在这里了。","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"好的，麻烦稍等一下。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":260},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#2$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"......","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"唉，我是被影月砸了脑袋吗？确信自己参展之后一定能赚回本钱，就雇了八十二个没有企业工作经验的门外汉充场面......","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"可这里的所有企业都是这么干的，为什么被淘汰的偏偏是“幸运瘤兽”？","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$2","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"就因为处理问题的速度慢了那么一点点，我上百万的金券就要打水漂了？开什么玩笑！","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$2","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"他妈的，一只靴子影月地产到底是怎么解决那个什么“三维浮空界桩”的技术问题的？就凭他们那群鞋匠？","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"雅斯彭先生，您的手续已经办理好了。今天之内，园区的热线电话依旧会向您开放。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#2$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"知道了......","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"但是，如果您像一只靴子影月地产公司一样，有一些“特殊”需求......我们也很愿意为您处理。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#4$1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"嗯？你的意思是？","id":279},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"charslot","id":281},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"微笑的工作人员拿出园区内几乎人手一本的联络黄页，向雅斯彭指出了一个电话号码。","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"没有抬头，没有地址，这串数字毫不起眼地藏身于几万个号码之中，就像雅斯彭微乎其微的希望。","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#4$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"只要打这个电话，我的问题就能解决？“幸运瘤兽”就可以不用离开园区？","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"是的。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#3$1","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"那我要撤回员工解雇合同，还有企业进驻资质的注销申请——","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"请放心，我并没有注销“幸运瘤兽”的进驻资格，不过体验员的解约协议无需撤回。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1041_1#1$1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"这通热线会“彻底”解决您的问题，您再也不需要那些人了。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1041_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"奇迹，还是骗局......？","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#3$1","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"不想了，只要能留在这里，试试又何妨。","id":298},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"charslot","id":301},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephone","volume":"1","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":303},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_makephonecall","volume":"1","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":305},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephonebusy","volume":"1","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":307},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"charslot","id":311},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"高登长官。","id":319},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":320,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"让我猜猜，娜斯提虽然将信将疑，但还是收下了我拟定的名单，答应了我的提议，对吗？","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"是的，我去确认了工程部今天的检修安排，完全按照您给定的顺序，一点不差。","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"不过，您是怎么知道的？","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#2$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我不知道她的最终选择，我只知道我正在经历自己人生中最辉煌的日子，无论做什么都会顺心如意！","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您看起来确实很高兴。","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#8$1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"小小一个莱茵主任还不足以调动我的情绪。","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"桌子上那封信，你打开看看。","id":334},{"type":"dialog","id":335},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"1","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"“烟酒施术单元以及源石制品管理局向高登·谭农长官发来贺函，祝贺您正式成为‘螺旋桨天堂’的总长官......”","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"两页纸？我从来没见过这么长的贺函。","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"六个月前我在哥伦比亚边境收到的调岗邮件里可只有两行字。","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"人人都觉得管理局的职位是个肥差，但那七年里，我可没在萨米的野人和萨尔贡雨林的土著身上刮到“油水”。","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"当时老狐狸看我不顺眼，管理局的其他人也不给我好脸色。结果呢？他退休了，我升职了，真是风水轮流转。","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"虽然还是大白天，但这么高兴的日子，就应该——","id":349},{"type":"dialog","id":350},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openbeer","volume":"1","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"小酌一杯。","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"长官，您的香槟。","id":356},{"type":"dialog","id":357},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_winglssice","volume":"1","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"小梅，做得不错。无论是娜斯提的事还是这杯酒，你在我身边也算是有些长进，给你自己也倒一杯吧。","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"十分感谢。不过根据秘书准则，工作时间不能饮酒。","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"在乎那些干什么，你的那本手册就是我瞎编的。","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"那......请您提两句祝酒词？","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"嗯......六天后的展会只是个起点，我的开幕致辞必将轰动整个哥伦比亚。","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我会亲眼看着所有火箭的外壳都刻上我的头像，影月都市里最大的街区也会以我的名字命名。","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#2$1","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"莱茵、管理局、特区政府......没人能压到我的头上。只要不出岔子，这里永远是高登·谭农的“螺旋桨天堂”！","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#2$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"干杯！","id":375},{"type":"playsound","key":"$clink","volume":"1","id":376},{"type":"dialog","id":377},{"type":"charslot","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":379},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":380},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"谁？赶着来参加我的派对吗？","id":384},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"charslot","id":386},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","posfrom":"250,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陌生的男子","text":"您好，请问您是园区总长官吗？","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陌生的男子","text":"我叫奥克里，“螺旋桨天堂”特聘的讲解员，来找高登长官报到。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"......","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#12$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"......","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"噗——！","id":398},{"type":"charslot","id":399},{"type":"text","text":"高登把刚刚喝进嘴里的香槟全部喷了出来。","id":400},{"type":"dialog","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":403},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":404},{"type":"charslot","id":405},{"type":"background","id":406},{"type":"image","id":407}],"characters":["惊慌的女孩","斯凯","街头混混A","街头混混B","？？？？","？？？","娜斯提","工作人员","雅斯彭","梅希亚","高登","陌生的男子"]}